    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW FREE EXPANSION RELEASED:\u00a0</strong>DIFFERENT SHADES OF DRAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside depicting DRAKE as a cuckold in the scenes with William, this extension will also present him as a dominant alpha male, relishing Eleanor as his prize, dressed provocatively in a cheerleader outfit in a communal changing room (where they won't be alone).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to these two storylines, we aim to incorporate 6 level relationship scenes, which include repeatable intimate scenes for WILLIAM and BEN, and one additional scene focused on a happy ending for the relationship between ELEANOR and DRAKE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/8daf051f73a126cf3e6c35bb4fc0afd5.avif?t=1744271477\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the mistakes you made in your past and be able to start your life fresh in sunny Florida. Eleanor was blessed with such an opportunity, and that\u2019s how the new chapter in her life begins. So the flashing lights of Miami, be ready - Eleanor is coming to town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/dfdf76e6a1265b88d671c02a3e00f104.avif?t=1744271477\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a captivating and non-linear story where Eleanor's presence and decisions dramatically shape the destinies of the intriguing characters she encounters in Miami. Depending on your choices, you may complete the game in 6 different ways. It\u2019s up to you if you\u2019re going to stay faithful to your husband or indulge yourself in romancing with other characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/c167934facb4242f7182af12c619b1e7.avif?t=1744271477\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We may call this game a visual novel with a relationship simulator. To progress the story, you need to interact with characters, improve your character stats and earn money to get items required for your tasks. It\u2019s hassle-free, without any time limit, with a precise hint system and the whole gameplay offers a lot of fun.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We gonna focus on 3 careers here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hairdresser in Faith salon, where Eleanor will have a chance to earn honest money without any crazy stunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >become a fashion model for Senka at first and then take part in more erotic sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >work for Bogdan as a croupier in his illegal casino and earn good money for doing kinky stuff with rich customers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/755d585e65436f0be2fb4fb772d8046d.avif?t=1744271477\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful narrative arc will revolve around Faith, which serves as the game\u2019s central premise. You\u2019ll gain more insight into her life, form an intimate bond with her spouse, and uncover a hidden truth. Whether you can help Faith or not rests in your gameplay choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/f130bc03424bfcf66cae46361429c804.avif?t=1744271477\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Senka and Bogdan have landed in Miami to pursue their clandestine objectives. Will you join them on their path to success or attempt to challenge them?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grace is Drake\u2019s colleague from work. Can you assist her in blossoming like a butterfly?<br>Hey, don\u2019t forget Cali from the bar \u2013 she eagerly awaits any wild escapade that Eleanor has up her sleeve. <br>And there is so much more to discover...  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be immersed in a stunning mix of visual novel and relationship-simulating elements as they make decisions that shape the main plot. Each character featured in the game has its unique storyline to discover, with various daily actions, stats, and events set in place to strengthen the gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/cb0274574594aa78c0eab4f30b98db57.avif?t=1744271477\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sexual content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleanor promised her husband to remain faithful, but you could still sway her actions. Inviting partners for sex in front of her husband is exciting, but being ravished by strangers when he isn't around is even more tantalizing. Choose whether you want her to be a devoted wife or a naughty vixen with no regrets.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/fdf676b6bc6fea7e1576ab878d73701e.avif?t=1744271477\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- desirable characters known from our previous games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- kinky story with plenty of hot scenes without any censorship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ultra-sharp and vivid 2560 \u00d7 1440 px visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- animated backgrounds for on map interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- hot sex scenes animations presented from 2 angles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- non-linear choices and 6 endings to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- sex scenes and endings gallery to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- scheduled content updates including new plots, scenes and characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
